{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to MeetnEat\u2122</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our fungal experts have finally created mushrooms girls! Eat them, love them, hurt yourself with them - It's all up to you, dear consumer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a lifespan of only 3 days, they'll conveniently dry up and die before the nagging wears you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807090/extras/df61927ba815991880c33336cb792a54.poster.webp?t=1750875964\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807090/extras/df61927ba815991880c33336cb792a54.webp?t=1750875964\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mushroom Girls in Stock:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow <strong>Button</strong>, an upbeat and playful mushroom who is perfectly fine with you eating her! She's the only one in stock in this demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go on dates and fall in love with your mushroom girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook her into delicious dishes - or see what happens if she lives too long.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kiss, snuggle, hold her hand, and literally sleep with her - or just be friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide or neglect her through her existential crises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to your dark thoughts or become better for her sake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spray her every day so she stays nice and moist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~90 minutes of gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1 Mushrooms. 9 Endings.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage Button's mental health and affection carefully.  Make your story as horrific or as heart-warming as you desire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807090/extras/4801ff55a41ddfc7c56706db2adb0677.avif?t=1750875964\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed. Please check the content warnings.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807090?t=1750875964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807090?t=1750875964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807090/b0bafaee5d40f65d43eb481ffa65e2629a7e89fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750875964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807090/b0bafaee5d40f65d43eb481ffa65e2629a7e89fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750875964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Anxiety/Depression\r\nSuicidal ideation/self-harm\r\nDeath"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to MeetnEat\u2122</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our fungal experts have finally created mushrooms girls! Eat them, love them, hurt yourself with them - It's all up to you, dear consumer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a lifespan of only 3 days, they'll conveniently dry up and die before the nagging wears you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807090/extras/df61927ba815991880c33336cb792a54.poster.webp?t=1750875964\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: redu